PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="4" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="5" RowSpan="1" Width="7086"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>0</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="5" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="5" RowSpan="1" Width="7090"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>browser.json·</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>browser.log</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="7086"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>참고 합계</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="7086"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>503</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="7086"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>503</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="3" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="7086"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>0</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="4" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="7086"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>0</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="5" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="7090"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>자동화시험목</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>록.md</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>503건은 서로 다른 시험 수준의 참고 합계다. 36개 D07 케이스와 별도 실환경 스크립트의 as</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>sertion을 더하지 않는다. PostgreSQL 실행의 deselected 15개는 -k postgres 선택에서 제외</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>된 SQLite 파라미터이며, 별도 Backend 실행에 포함되었다. 최종 결과의 skipped는 0이다. lin</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>t와 TypeScript 타입 검사도 통과했다. Backend 의존 라이브러리의 경고 2건은 남아 있다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="true" ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="7"><CHAR>3. 테스트 케이스 및 수행 결과</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"><CHAR>3.1 시스템 시나리오 14건</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>표의 ‘실제 결과’와 판정을 함께 사용한다. B의 하위 시험 통과를 전체 케이스 통과로 해석하</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>지 않는다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="12"><CHAR>STC-MON-001 · PC 연결·백업·복구·해제</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="2" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="6"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="400003" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="0"><SIZE Height="19600" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="42520" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Column" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="true" Height="2100" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="9779"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>구분</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="true" Height="2100" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="32741"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>내용</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="5100" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="9779"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>입력 / 절차</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="5100" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="32741"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>웹에서 미동의/동의 연결, Windows 다운로드, 일회용 코드 교환. CPU </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>48%, 가용 8192MB·온도 null 스냅샷 2개. 별도 브라우저로 조회키 복</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>구 후 해제.</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="9779"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>예상 결과</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="32741"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>미동의 차단, 코드 1회 사용, 수치·결측·이력 표시, 복구 및 해제 후 401</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>, XSS 실행 없음, 390px 가로 넘침 없음.</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="9779"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>실제 결과</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="32741"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>15건 브라우저 묶음 중 해당 시나리오 통과. 다운로드는 명시적 모의 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>EXE로 경로·파일명을 확인하며 실제 설치 성공을 뜻하지 않는다.</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="2100" Protect="false" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="9779"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>판정 / 검토</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST