>실행에서 일치</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="3" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="9600" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="7655"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>P·검토 완료 / </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>agent/tests/tes</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>t_agent.py; ag</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>ent/tests/test_</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>security.py; ag</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>ent.xml</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="9354"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>ATC-AGT-022 / D</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>B 마이그레이션·정</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>리</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="11905"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>신규/기존 DB·반복 마이</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>그레이션·조건부 정리</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="13606"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>기존 스냅샷 보존, 반복 안</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>전, 조건 자료만 정리 — 현</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>재 실행에서 일치</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="3" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="7655"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>P·검토 완료 / </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>agent/tests/tes</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>t_m2_m3.py; a</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>gent.xml</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="true" ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="7"><CHAR>4. 테스트 예외사항과 정정 내역</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="3" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="5"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="400025" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="0"><SIZE Height="29000" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="42520" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Column" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="true" Height="2100" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="10204"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>구분</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="true" Height="2100" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="12756"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>최초 관찰</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="true" Height="2100" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="19560"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>처리·재시험</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="5100" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="10204"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>Agent 실행 환경</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="5100" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="12756"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>프로젝트 루트에서 실행해</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR> speccheck_agent import </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>실패 8건</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="5100" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="19560"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>원래 지정된 agent 작업 폴더에서 전 묶</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>음 재실행, 125건 통과. 최초 로그·XML </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>보존</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="10204"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>브라우저 시험 코드</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="12756"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>포트8051로 실행했는데 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>복구용 새 창이8031로 고</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>정되어 연결 거부. 최초 14</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>통과·1실패</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="19560"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>monitor.spec.cjs의 복구 주소를 testInfo.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>project.use.baseURL로 변경. 같은 포트80</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>51에서 전체15건 재실행 통과</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="10204"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>실환경 검증 코드</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="12756"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>원문 +00:00과 Pydantic </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>정규화 Z를 문자열로 직접</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR> 비교하여 실패</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="19560"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>같은 시각의 계약 정규화를 적용한 전체 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>스냅샷 비교로 수정. 실제 데이터 필드의 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>동일성 기준은 유지. 초기 runtime 로그 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>보존</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="10204"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>외부 의존 조건</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="12756"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>Sysmon 로그 권한·eBay </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>인증·Ollama 모델·운영 재</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>시작 접근 없음</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="19560"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>사용자에게 추가 설정 존재를 확인했고 ‘</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>별도 설정 없음, 현재 환경에서 가능한 검</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>증 진행’ 답변. B4건을 통과로 변경하지 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>않음</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>현재 제품 소스는 이 검증에서 변경하지 않았다. 수정 파일은 브라우저 시험의 실행 주소와 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>검증·보고서 생성 스크립트다. 이전에 구현된 견적 API·가격 fallback 제거·Canvas 해제 제한</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>을 현재 회귀로 확인했다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>시험 DB와 Agent 저장소는 .deployment-tmp/d07-final-real에 격리했다. 10개 합성 연결은 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>종료 시 삭제하고 읽기키의401을 확인했다. 임시 PostgreSQL 컨테이너·익명 볼륨과 검증 서</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>버를 정리했다. 기존 Docker 서비스는 중단하지 않았다. 원본 실측 스냅샷은 공개 증빙 ZIP에</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR> 포함하지 않는다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="true" ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="7"><CHAR>5. 테스트 환경</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"><CHAR>5.1 구성</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>Windows11 호스트에서 Python3.12.6, pytest8.2.0, Node24.14.0, Playwright1.56.1 및 설치된 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>Microsoft Edge를 사용했다. API는 FastAPI/Uvicorn, 저장은 격리 SQLite와 Docker PostgreS</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>QL17이다. 상세 실제 버전·권한·소스 해시는 environment.json과 source-manifest.json을 따</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>른다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>실환경 HTTP 서버는127.0.0.1:8052, PostgreSQL은127.0.0.1:55433에만 바인딩했다. 브라우저 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>회귀는127.0.0.1:8051의 별도 서버·SQLite를 사용했다. 합성 상품 응답과 실수집 데이터를 각 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>케이스에 명시했다. 실제 키·DB 암호를 보고서에 넣지 않는다. 공개 Render 서버의 이번 읽기</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR> 전용 확인에서도 인증서 검증을 켠 HTTPS health200, 모니터링 enabled/persistent=true, 개</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>발API·.env·.git/config404를 확인했다(public-probe.json). 운영 재시작 검증을 대신하지 않는</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"><CHAR>5.2 반복 전송 기준과 측정 한계</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>STC-REAL-014는 목표가 비어 있던 케이스에 대해 검증자가 실행 전에 10대·30초 간격·10분, </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>오류/누락/중복0, 업로드 p95≤2초·최대≤5초의 로컬 기준을 정했다. 이는 팀이 승인한 운영 S</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>LA가 아니다. 21라운드의 시각과 최대 응답시간은 runtime.json의 timeline에 보존했다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>측정한 응답시간은 첫 업로드 HTTP 왕복이다. 동일 ID 재전송·최신 조회·이력 개수 확인을 매</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR> 라운드 수행하고 중간에 Backend와 DB를 재시작했다. DB 크기는 종료 시 절대 크기이며 샘</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>플당 성장률이나 최대 수용량으로 해석하지 않는다. 24시간·실제10대 물리 PC·외부 네트워크·</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>모바일 전체 조합은 확인한 범위 밖이다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="true" ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="7"><CHAR>6. 검토 결과와 종료 판정</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"><CHAR>6.1 기존 관찰사항 처리</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="2" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="8"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="400026" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="0"><SIZE Height="27300" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="42520" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Column" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="true" Height="2100" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="9779"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>ID</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="true" Height="2100" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="32741"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>최신 검토 결과</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="9779"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>OBS-01</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="32741"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>현재 견적→상세 화면의 서버 계산값 일치·미등록 점수 보류 통과. 기</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>존 고정 점수 문제 해소 확인</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="9779"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>OBS-02</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="32741"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>실제 응답값 보존·오류 시 가격 미확인·이전 예시값 무효화·가격 없는 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>후보 차단 통과</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="9779"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>OBS-03</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="32741"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>공개 모니터링3개 섹션과 Basic Scan 전체 수집 범위 차이를 명시. 계</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>약을 같다고 판정하지 않음</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="9779"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>OBS-04</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="32741"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>실수집·로컬PostgreSQL·기존공개HTTPS 증빙 확인. 관리자Sysmon·외</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>부운영재시작은 B</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="5" RowSpan="1" Width="9779"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>OBS-05</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="5" RowSpan="1" Width="32741"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>실제eBay 인증·Ollama 모델 부재를 실제 요청으로 확인. 성공 조회/생</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>성으로 계상하지 않음. 커뮤니티 크롤링 실성공 근거도 없음</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="9779"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>OBS-06</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="6" RowSpan="1" Width="32741"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>기기10대 반복·로컬재시작·삭제 수행. EXE 설치/GUI 전과정·24시간운</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>용·원격재배포의 인수 완료는 아님</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="7" RowSpan="1" Width="9779"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>OBS-07</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="7" RowSpan="1" Width="32741"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>D04 US-25~30의 전후·예측 인수 요구사항을 검토. 일부 견적교체만 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>구현, 조치메모·전후비교·오차계산은 미충족</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"><CHAR>6.2 환경 차단과 필요한 후속 조건</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="3" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="5"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="400027" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="0"><SIZE Height="16500" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="42520" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Column" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="true" Height="2100" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="10204"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>케이스</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="true" Height="2100" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="12756"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>완료에 필요한 조건</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="true" Height="2100" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="19560"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>조건 확보 후 재시험</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="10204"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>STC-REAL-008</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="12756"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>관리자 또는 Sysmon 로그</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR> 읽기 권한</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="19560"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>실제 이벤트 수집→전송→표시→철회 후 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>차단</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="10204"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>STC-REAL-009</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="12756"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>운영 서버·외부DB 재시작 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>접근</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="19560"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>재시작 전후 스냅샷·이력·키·삭제 일치</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="10204"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>STC-REAL-010</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="12756"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>eBay OAuth 또는 client I</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>D/secret</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="3" RowSpan="1" Width="19560"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>신품/중고 실제 제공자 원본과 가격·상태·</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>배송비·통화 비교</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="10204"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>STC-REAL-011</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="12756"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>실행 중 Ollama와 지원 G</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>emma 모델</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="3600" Protect="false" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="19560"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>근거 중심 실제 생성과 모델 중단 후 같</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>은 규칙의 템플릿</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="true" ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="12"><CHAR>6.2 환경 차단과 필요한 후속 조건 (계속)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>검토 완료: STC14/14, ATC22/22, D04 사용자 스토리30/30. 실제 수행 완료: STC10/14·ATC22</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>/22. 환경 차단4건과 아래 D04 미충족 항목이 있어 전체 시스템 최종 합격은 보류한다. 미검</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>토 항목은 없지만 사용자 환경의 선행 조건을 대신 확보하거나 수행하지 않은 시나리오를 통</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>과시킬 수는 없다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>검토자는 Codex이며, 이는 로그·계약·소스에 대한 기술 검토다. 팀원 또는 책임교수의 인수 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>승인·서명을 의미하지 않는다. 종료 예정일2026년11월17일의 미래 결과를 선기재하지 않는</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="true" ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="7"><CHAR>7. 부록</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"><CHAR>7.1 요구사항 원본과 전수 대조</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>finaloutput/SpecCheck_D04_프로덕트_백로그.hwp의 사용자 스토리US-01~30과 인수 기준을</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR> 직접 추출해 대조했다. D04 자체는 공동 검토용 초안이며 승인 문서로 임의 간주하지 않는</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>다. ‘확인’은 적은 범위의 코드·실행 근거가 해당 기준을 뒷받침한다는 검토 결과로, 전체 제품</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>/백로그 승인률을 뜻하지 않는다. ‘부분’과 ‘미충족’을 합격으로 계산하지 않는다. 인수 기준 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>원문·구체 근거는 case-results.json에 모두 포함했다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="3" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="6"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="400028" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="0"><SIZE Height="37100" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="42520" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Column" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="true" Height="2100" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="10204"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>요구사항</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="true" Height="2100" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="12756"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>검토 상태</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="true" Height="2100" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="19560"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>확인 내용과 제한</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="10204"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>US-01</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="12756"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>검토 완료·부분</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="6600" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="19560"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>견적 입력은 가능하나 상품 상태 선호 입</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>력과 예산0 거부 기준 미충족. 현재 0은 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>입력 합계로 처리. 근거: frontend/web/in</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>put.html; frontend/web/js/script.js</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="8100" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="10204"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>US-02</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="8100" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="12756"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>검토 완료·미충족</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="8100" Protect="false" RowAddr="2" RowSpan="1" Width="19560"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>전체 PC 두 후보의 7종 부품 나란히 비교</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR> 구현 근거 없음. 단일 견적·개별 교체 후</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaS