IDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>미등록 성능·미확인 가격은 수치 보류, 현</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>재 PC 실측과 벤치마크 구분. FPS 향상 </CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>보장 없음. 근거: estimate.spec.cjs; fronte</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>nd/web/js/estimate-engine.js</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="9600" Protect="false" RowAddr="7" RowSpan="1" Width="10204"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>US-28</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="9600" Protect="false" RowAddr="7" RowSpan="1" Width="12756"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>검토 완료·미충족</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="9600" Protect="false" RowAddr="7" RowSpan="1" Width="19560"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>조치 메모·전후 스캔 ID를 묶는 인수 기준</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>의 통합 구현/API 없음. 로컬 note에 따른</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR> baseline 갱신·단순 스냅샷 이력으로 대</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>체 불가. 근거: backend/app/api/routes/s</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>can.py; agent/speccheck_agent/pipeline/</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>; agent/tests/test_advanced.py</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="5100" Protect="false" RowAddr="8" RowSpan="1" Width="10204"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>US-29</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="5100" Protect="false" RowAddr="8" RowSpan="1" Width="12756"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>검토 완료·미충족</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="5100" Protect="false" RowAddr="8" RowSpan="1" Width="19560"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>작업/단위 일치 확인 후 전후 원값·차이를</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR> 보여주는 통합 경로 없음. 근거: backend</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>/app/api/routes; frontend/web</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="true" ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="12"><CHAR>7.1 요구사항 원본과 전수 대조 (계속)</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="3" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="2"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="400032" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="0"><SIZE Height="8200" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="42520" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Column" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="true" Height="2100" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="10204"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>요구사항</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="true" Height="2100" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="12756"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>검토 상태</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="true" Height="2100" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="19560"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="10"><CHAR>확인 내용과 제한</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="5100" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="10204"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>US-30</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="5100" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="12756"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>검토 완료·미충족</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="4" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="true" HasMargin="true" Header="false" Height="5100" Protect="false" RowAddr="1" RowSpan="1" Width="19560"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="300" Left="280" Right="280" Top="300"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>예상+8·실측+5의 오차-3 계산 및 짝 없</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>는 값 제외의 인수 경로 없음. 근거: back</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>end/app/api/routes; frontend/web</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"><CHAR>7.2 증빙 파일과 재현</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="16" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="13"/></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>이번 직접 근거는 outputs/reports/evidence/d07-final-20261109/에 있다. case-results.json은</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>36건 입력·기대·실제·판정과30건 백로그 대조를 담고, 자동화시험목록.md는503개 개별 항목</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>을 담는다. 원래204건 로그와 기존 실환경/HTTPS 증빙은 상위evidence 폴더에 보존한다. H</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>ML 제출본과 최신 Markdown은 같은 판정 데이터를 사용한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>Python 시험은agent/backend 각 작업폴더에서 .deployment-tmp/venv-py312/Scripts/pytho</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>n.exe -X utf8 -m pytest tests -q로 재현한다. Backend는TELEMETRY_API_ENABLED=true, M</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>ONITOR_TEST_DATABASE_URL 비움, LLM_ENABLED=false를 지정한다. PostgreSQL 파라미터</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>는 격리DB를 지정해 -k postgres로 선택한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>UI 로직: npm run test:ui. 정적 검사: npm run lint, npm run typecheck. 브라우저: frontend/t</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>ests에서SPECCHECK_TEST_PYTHON을 같은Python 절대경로, MONITOR_TEST_BROWSER=m</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>sedge, SPECCHECK_TEST_PORT=8051로 지정하고Playwright를 실행한다. 실행별 새 증빙 경</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>로를 사용한다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>실수집·격리PostgreSQL·10분 반복 시험은run_real_checks.py로 재현한다. 실행 전 임시 컨테</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>이너 이름과 포트의 충돌 여부를 확인한다. finalize_report.py는최종 로그를 검증하고 판정표·</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="14" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"><CHAR>Markdown·HML·증빙ZIP을 생성한다. 사람의 인수 서명은 생성하지 않는다.</CHAR></TEXT></P></SECTION></BODY><TAIL><SCRIPTCODE Type="JScript" Version="1.0"><SCRIPTHEADER></SCRIPTHEADER><SCRIPTSOURCE></SCRIPTSOURCE></SCRIPTCODE></TAIL></HWPML>